* Cell Name:    ColumnMux
* View Name:    schematic
************************************************************************

.SUBCKT ColumnMux BL BLB SA_BL SA_BLB VDD VSS WD_BL WD_BLB YSR
*.PININFO VDD:I VSS:I YSR:I SA_BL:O SA_BLB:O BL:B BLB:B WD_BL:B WD_BLB:B
